Third-party data (not source code; fetched at build/update time, not shipped
in this repository):

- NVD CVE JSON 2.0 feeds and CISA KEV catalogue — U.S. Government works,
  public domain.
- OSV.dev distribution security advisories (Ubuntu, Debian, Red Hat, Rocky,
  AlmaLinux) — under their respective upstream licenses.
- webappanalyzer web technology fingerprints
  (https://github.com/enthec/webappanalyzer) — GPL-3.0. The `http_tech`
  technology->CPE map is derived from its `cpe` fields by
  scripts/gen_http_tech.py and is fetched/generated at build time; it is not
  distributed as part of this source tree.

Nmap's service-probe database, when used by `bunyip-update review-products`,
is read from the local Nmap installation and is not redistributed here.
